bstet Gynecol</source><year>1977</year><volume>75</volume><fpage>29</fpage><lpage>32</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Eur J Obstet Gynecol||75|29||bib16|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ozawa</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic and functional changes in mitochondria associated with ageing</article-title><source>Physiol Rev</source><year>1997</year><volume>77</volume><fpage>425</fpage><lpage>464</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Physiol Rev||77|425||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9114820</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Papa</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mitochondrial oxidative phosporylation changes in the life span. Molecular aspects and physiopathological implications</article-title><source>Biochem Biophys Acta</source><year>1996</year><volume>1276</volume><fpage>87</fpage><lpage>105</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Biochem Biophys Acta||1276|87||bib18|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sanderson</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Shu</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Jin</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Dai Ruan</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Goa</surname><given-names>Y-T</given-names></name><name><surname>Zheng</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Weight at birth and adolescence and pre-menopasual breast cancer risk in a low-risk population</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>2002</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>84</fpage><lpage>88</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||86|84||bib19|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11857016</pu